---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '@/components/ui/PageHero.astro';
import Split from '@/components/ui/Split.astro';
import Button from '@/components/ui/Button.astro';
import Strata from '@/components/art/Strata.astro';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '@/components/seo/schema';
import { principles } from '@/data/principles';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="The purpose, perspective and founder behind Tarvanta, an insights-led global venture platform."
  schema={breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'About', path: '/about/' }])}
>
  <PageHero
    page="About"
    statement="Good ideas deserve more than a quick start."
    lede="Tarvanta is being built around a simple conviction: meaningful problems deserve careful attention, and worthwhile ideas deserve the discipline to become something useful."
  />

  <div class="h-40 md:h-56" aria-hidden="true">
    <Strata stems={[0.78]} seed={5} layers={11} />
  </div>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="page-wrap">
      <Split>
        <h2 slot="heading" id="why-title" class="t-heading max-w-[14ch]">Why Tarvanta exists</h2>
        <div class="prose-body">
          <p>Many business conversations begin with a proposed solution. The more useful starting point is often the question that came before it: what is not working, for whom, and why has it remained unresolved?</p>
          <p>Tarvanta is an insights-led global venture platform intended to connect that first investigation with practical development. It is not tied to one sector, product or service. Its focus is the quality of the problem, the strength of the evidence and the usefulness of the response.</p>
          <p>A sound response may become an independent venture. It may also be a product, a partnership, a different operating model or a decision to leave an idea unbuilt.</p>
        </div>
      </Split>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section border-t border-stone" aria-labelledby="purpose-title">
    <div class="page-wrap">
      <Split>
        <h2 slot="heading" id="purpose-title" class="t-heading max-w-[14ch]">Purpose and ambition</h2>
        <div class="prose-body">
          <p class="t-lede text-charcoal">To turn well-understood problems into considered action, and to build ventures only where the case is strong enough.</p>
          <p>Tarvanta's ambition is international, with an Indian perspective and an open view of where useful ideas can originate. The platform is designed to connect insight with execution, while allowing future ventures to develop their own identities and serve their own markets.</p>
          <p>Its wider purpose is to use the knowledge, relationships and capacity developed through responsible growth to contribute to worthwhile causes. That is an ambition to work towards, not a claim of an established impact programme.</p>
        </div>
      </Split>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="on-dark bg-charcoal text-ink-on-dark" aria-labelledby="operating-title">
    <div class="page-wrap section">
      <Split>
        <h2 slot="heading" id="operating-title" class="t-heading max-w-[14ch] text-paper">How the platform is designed to operate</h2>
        <div class="prose-body">
          <p class="text-ink-on-dark">Tarvanta is intended to hold the work that benefits from continuity: research, strategic thinking, standards and long-term direction. Independent ventures should retain what needs to belong to them: their name, brand, product, voice and customer relationships.</p>
          <p class="text-ink-on-dark">This separation is deliberate. It gives each venture room to respond to its market without losing the benefit of a shared foundation.</p>
          <p><a href="/approach/" class="link">See the approach stage by stage</a></p>
        </div>
      </Split>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="founder-editorial section" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
    <div class="page-wrap">
      <div class="founder-grid">
        <div class="founder-visual">
          <div class="founder-orbit founder-orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="founder-orbit founder-orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="founder-orbit-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <figure class="founder-portrait">
            <img src="/founder-insight-into-action.webp" alt="Lalit Yadav, founder of Tarvanta" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="founder-image-caption">
            <span>THE FOUNDER</span>
            <strong>Lalit Yadav</strong>
            <span>INSIGHT · PERSPECTIVE · MEANINGFUL ACTION</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="founder-copy">
          <p class="t-label">A belief in better questions — and more considered answers.</p>
          <h2 id="founder-title" class="t-heading">Lalit Yadav</h2>
          <p class="founder-role">FOUNDER <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> TARVANTA</p>
          <p class="founder-deck">Insight. Perspective. Meaningful action.</p>

          <div class="prose-body">
            <p>Every meaningful venture begins with a question. What are we overlooking? Where is the real opportunity? And how can a promising idea become something with lasting relevance?</p>
            <p>These questions sit at the heart of Lalit Yadav's approach to building Tarvanta. His perspective is grounded in a simple conviction: information alone does not create progress. It is the ability to interpret information, recognise patterns, challenge assumptions and translate understanding into practical direction that makes the difference.</p>
            <p>Tarvanta is being developed around this belief — bringing together strategic thinking, business storytelling and entrepreneurial ambition within an independent global venture platform.</p>
            <p>The ambition is not to build for visibility alone, but to explore opportunities thoughtfully, develop independent perspectives and create ventures with purpose and long-term relevance.</p>
          </div>

          <blockquote class="founder-note">
            <span class="founder-note-label">A NOTE FROM THE FOUNDER</span>
            <p>“I believe the most valuable progress often begins with taking a step back — understanding the bigger picture, asking better questions and looking beyond the obvious.</p>
            <p>Tarvanta represents that belief. It is a platform for exploring ideas, developing perspectives and building possibilities with intention.</p>
            <p>The journey is ongoing. The ambition is to make the thinking count.”</p>
          </blockquote>

          <div class="founder-credentials">
            <p>His documented experience includes working as a Business Presentation Specialist at McKinsey &amp; Company in Bengaluru and as a Senior Presentations Associate with Williams Lea in London. He has also worked across customer support, marketing and corporate communications.</p>
            <p>Lalit studied digital marketing at the University of Salford, including a semester exchange at the Berlin School of Economics and Law, and holds a BBA in Marketing from Alliance University.</p>
            <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lalit-presentationspecialist/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Connect with Lalit on LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
          <p class="founder-mantra">THINK DEEPLY. &nbsp; COMMUNICATE CLEARLY. &nbsp; ACT MEANINGFULLY.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section border-t border-stone bg-paper" aria-labelledby="values-title">
    <div class="page-wrap">
      <div class="max-w-[38rem]">
        <h2 id="values-title" class="t-heading">Principles that guide the work</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-graphite">These are the standards Tarvanta intends to apply, including when the evidence argues against an idea.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="mt-14 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mt-20 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {principles.map((p) => (
          <div class="border-t border-charcoal pt-6">
            <dt class="t-subheading">{p.title}</dt>
            <dd class="mt-3 text-graphite">{p.body}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <div class="page-wrap flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <h2 id="next-title" class="t-heading max-w-[20ch]">A thoughtful question is a good place to begin.</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-5">
        <Button href="/approach/">Our approach</Button>
        <Button href="/contact/" variant="quiet">Start a conversation</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .founder-editorial { overflow: hidden; }
  .founder-grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem); align-items: center; }
  .founder-visual { min-height: 34rem; position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; isolation: isolate; }
  .founder-portrait { width: min(76vw, 30rem); aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; position: relative; z-index: 2; background: #292822; box-shadow: 0 2rem 5rem rgba(35,34,31,.18); }
  .founder-portrait img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 72% 45%; filter: grayscale(1) sepia(.16) contrast(1.04); transform: scale(1.08); transition: transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1); }
  .founder-visual:hover .founder-portrait img { transform: scale(1.13); }
  .founder-orbit { position: absolute; border: 1px solid rgba(160,122,69,.58); border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none; }
  .founder-orbit-one { width: min(88vw, 35rem); aspect-ratio: 1; animation: orbit-turn 34s linear infinite; }
  .founder-orbit-two { width: min(98vw, 39rem); aspect-ratio: 1; border-style: dashed; opacity: .48; animation: orbit-turn 52s linear infinite reverse; }
  .founder-orbit-dot { position: absolute; z-index: 3; width: .8rem; height: .8rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-bronze); top: 13%; right: 17%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 .45rem rgba(160,122,69,.12); animation: dot-breathe 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .founder-image-caption { position: absolute; z-index: 4; left: 0; bottom: 1rem; display: grid; gap: .25rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; background: rgba(35,34,31,.92); color: var(--color-ink-on-dark); }
  .founder-image-caption span, .founder-role, .founder-note-label, .founder-mantra { font: 500 .66rem/1.5 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .19em; }
  .founder-image-caption strong { font: 400 1.5rem/1.2 var(--font-display); }
  .founder-copy { max-width: 48rem; }
  .founder-copy h2 { margin-top: .65rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); }
  .founder-role { margin-top: .4rem; color: var(--color-graphite); }
  .founder-role span { color: var(--color-bronze); padding-inline: .5rem; }
  .founder-deck { margin: 1.6rem 0 2.4rem; font: italic 400 clamp(1.4rem, 2.2vw, 2rem)/1.3 var(--font-display); }
  .founder-note { margin: 2.5rem 0; padding: 1.5rem 0 1.5rem 1.5rem; border-left: 2px solid var(--color-bronze); font: italic 400 1.18rem/1.55 var(--font-display); }
  .founder-note p + p { margin-top: .75rem; }
  .founder-note-label { display: block; margin-bottom: .9rem; color: var(--color-bronze); font-style: normal; }
  .founder-credentials { margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone); color: var(--color-graphite); font-size: .92rem; }
  .founder-credentials p + p { margin-top: .8rem; }
  .founder-credentials a { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .founder-mantra { margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone); color: var(--color-graphite); }
  @keyframes orbit-turn { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  @keyframes dot-breathe { 50% { transform: scale(1.35); box-shadow: 0 0 0 .8rem rgba(160,122,69,.04); } }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .founder-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(22rem, .9fr) minmax(28rem, 1.1fr); } .founder-visual { position: sticky; top: 7rem; } }
  @media (max-width: 899px) { .founder-visual { min-height: 28rem; } .founder-orbit-two { width: min(96vw, 34rem); } .founder-image-caption { left: 2%; bottom: 0; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .founder-orbit-one, .founder-orbit-two, .founder-orbit-dot { animation: none !important; } .founder-portrait img { transition: none; } }
</style>
